{
  "name": "Generic tissue",
  "note": "The default list for spatial transcriptomics (Visium / Visium HD) when no list is given. Written from widely used textbook marker genes, not copied from a marker database. A bin can hold several cells, so the names describe neighbourhoods ('T-cell rich'), not single cells. Gene names are matched case-insensitively, so the same file works for human (PECAM1) and mouse (Pecam1). A type needs at least 2 of its genes in the data to be scored. For a tissue-specific list (e.g. markers/nerve.json) pass --markers.",
